<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.SetContentType(HTTPRequestID: uuid, ContentType: number)`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`llSetContentType(key HTTPRequestID, integer ContentType);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Sets the [](https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/File:Wikipedia-16px.png)&#8201;<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Internet_media_type" target="_blank">Internet media type</a> `"Content-Type"` header of any subsequent <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LSL_HTTP_server" target="_blank">LSL HTTP server</a> response via <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlHTTPResponse" target="_blank">llHTTPResponse</a>.</p>
</p>
